<title>JAPAN: MOTORCYCLING-JAPANESE GRAND PRIX 250CC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-JAPANESE GRAND PRIX 250CC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SUZUKA, Japan 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Japanese</p>
<p>Grand Prix 250cc category on Sunday:</p>
<p>Race distance: 19 laps, 111.416 km</p>
<p>  1. Daijiro Kato (Japan) Honda  41 minutes 42.226 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Toru Ukawa (Japan) Honda	   41:42.434</p>
<p>  3. Tetsuya Harada (Japan) Aprilia   41:42.544</p>
<p>  4. Takeshi Tsujimura (Japan)  Honda 41:43.234  </p>
<p>  5. Ralf Waldmann (Germany) Honda    41:47.790</p>
<p>  6. Yukio Kageyama (Japan) Suzuki    42:03.264</p>
<p>  7. Max Biaggi (Italy) Honda	   42:10.107</p>
<p>  8. Haruchika Aoki (Japan) Honda     42:10.147</p>
<p>  9. Noriyasu Numata (Japan) Suzuki   42:10.544</p>
<p> 10. Naoki Matsudo (Japan) Yamaha     42:12.400</p>
